        "question": "Question: A developer reports that `cc_result = g.connectedComponents()` throws an `IllegalArgumentException` complaining about a missing checkpoint directory, even though they ran `spark.conf.set(\"spark.cleaner.referenceTracking.cleanCheckpoints\", \"true\")`. How do you fix it?",
