        "answer": "The dimension table uses random salting instead of a deterministic cross join",
        "explanation": "A fact record with salt 4 will only match a dimension record if that specific dimension record randomly received salt 4. Massive amounts of valid matches will be lost. The dimension table MUST be replicated via cross join for all salt values.",
